identifier: AudioMufflerRedux
name: Audio Muffler Redux (AMR)
abstract: A simple mod that deadens the game's audio as your vessel goes into vacuum in KSP.
description: This mod makes sounds feel more realistic by muffling your audio to lower and lower frequencies as the air around your vessel gets less and less dense. This is a continuation of the work of SerTheGreat and NovaSilisko.
